        "original_id": "1bf1873a-c67a-5595-b45e-822c12ce26c0",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Simon Wincer, Patrice Leconte, Walter Farley, Steven Farley\n- Works: The Young Black Stallion, Beauties at War, La guerre des Miss\n- Roles: film director, film producer, actor, comic strip writer, screenwriter\n\nFacts:\n- Simon Wincer was born in 1943 in Sydney and is an Australian film director and film producer.\n- Patrice Leconte was born on 12 November 1947 and is a French film director, actor, comic strip writer, and screenwriter.\n- The Young Black Stallion was directed by Simon Wincer and was based on the 1989 novel of the same name by Walter Farley and Steven Farley.\n- Beauties at War was originally titled La guerre des Miss in French, aired in France on 9 January 2009, and was directed by Patrice Leconte.",
